#: scenario:scenario_28D6040B_1653_440E_9709_DD0BF42A7F92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98be9b3ca1fd5a916e0b1f7584703a21e68ce684af3022ccd37b5ddd13d33558
#. default-sha256: a062fb702295c2adc35ab95780b48cb002a2a27bab1c12b4672639328cc973eb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_28D6040B_1653_440E_9709_DD0BF42A7F92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Hahh, ⟪k:19⟫hah... ⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫haahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫――허억, ⟪k:19⟫헉, ⟪k:20⟫……허억……!"

#: scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 991592f56a84fc8d41b28aa4fe00e3fa4b1285834ab6712e536b7d57c5e23732
#. default-sha256: 8d9f627ede41bffb7c9e6b3180c3cb5aa4773fbe01c732774c04cf85de31dc24
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In a fevered frenzy, Mell fled from the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫Even in early summer, the night was "
"cold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜은 충동에 떠밀려 ⟪k:1⟫저택에서 뛰쳐나왔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫초여름이라지만 ⟪k:4⟫밤은 쌀쌀하지"
"요."

#: scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f041043348a603df398c097d2aed29623c4132cb2ad34e2e804f91c6ee426a4d
#. default-sha256: f5e64a0a6cd7a361e84a80871819e0b56749204baead6757b92e5490b1db0b2b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And to make matters worse, raindrops pelted him from head to toe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫멜의 온몸에 내려치는 ⟪k:1⟫따가운 빗방울."

#: scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b53a58907ebf98347d032b950bcb8574e4db32db58c0fbbc668325c32354245
#. default-sha256: 98c1ccc2e88537c8bd22eb9fc5d26a77a520c5a68c88e030894015926914c86e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that caused him little discomfort, for a far greater maelstrom of pain rampaged within "
"his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 멜은 그게 ⟪k:1⟫고통스럽진 않았습니다. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫진정한 고통은 마음 속에 휘몰아쳤으니까"
"요."

#: scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17d023f4a6df2e99873febd423a346bdd34bc8a65071bbb94c5dbb14f26b73ff
#. default-sha256: 46a97991f7369963a2f15534e1f97591ba223a8acbd953daabc6c819c3ff718c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At night, the town took on a different appearance. ⟪k:1⟫Not simply for lack of illumination, "
"but the people active within it as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫밤거리는 ⟪k:1⟫낮과 달라집니다. ⟪k:2⟫불빛만 꺼진 게 다가 아니라, ⟪k:3⟫거길 돌아다니는 인간 자"
"체가 달라지지요."

#: scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be27da562c49c857ed07cd143a54f032590fa6fb8dff2fe773da1890c6cc3823
#. default-sha256: 21b632bf8bd9293258d09bf4012eae44349307b546639ff87e769256c2249052
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not a suitable place for a young aristocratic man to go wandering unattended."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫귀족 청년이 ⟪k:1⟫생각 없이 돌아다녀도 될 곳이 아닙니다."

#: scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb74a09f60f54f1e59e49e660b5371a37b41f7a513fe9ab49c53ca4131ac40fe
#. default-sha256: d12006a7a1b4393a5de8e4ede67345fe9d4d3b31e0e8b097cc762502e007b2b0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness is not only the abode of devils, but of beggars, thieves, criminals, and all "
"manner of things undesirable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어둠은 악마를 부를 뿐만 아니라, ⟪k:1⟫거지, ⟪k:2⟫강도, ⟪k:3⟫범죄자, ⟪k:4⟫모든 부정적인 존재를 "
"⟪k:5⟫꼬이게 하거든요."

#: scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d06c83c02f292b91ec5b0d2c3046cbd7f25dcc627333ef670520b4c68327a0c
#. default-sha256: 1c378ce91d742daafb867a52eef13b4302e6befacb8e75fe5235b1c4e491a96a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………!"

#: scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1c1286fe9deab7567063e43be6388d690bbe0108084a9bb7e0f566a6d29ba12
#. default-sha256: 86505cf9f6880bc76f53d871a01e2fff755b12974b30ea6c499350c66a67c24c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite that, he continued to run, knowing not where he was to head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 멜은 개의치 않고 달렸습니다. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫멜 본인은 ⟪k:3⟫어디로 가야 할지도 ⟪k:4⟫몰랐을 "
"겁니다."

#: scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edc7c7f9b5b3b2e213b124b55131b438acc25790ff454b38c689cf1120c38b45
#. default-sha256: 4ba1fdc74181823efbfbde730364e44487723a04d6b3609afbfd46bb9e079407
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He simply went where his feet took him. ⟪k:1⟫And where he arrived was the church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫오로지 ⟪k:1⟫다리가 움직이는 대로 달렸지요. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그리하여 결국―― ⟪k:4⟫도착한 곳은 ⟪k:5⟫교"
"회 입구였습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_A737D17B_7F90_44CE_BBCC_E5F99BB3C160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d35ec4e23be477739a61f113fcb89e08b4748d45c59ac75f70e01239abe88ef
