msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God... ⟪k:1⟫God should be able to offer me counsel.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(주님이라면―― ⟪k:1⟫주님이라면 ⟪k:2⟫뭐든 알려 주실 거야)"

#: scenario:scenario_182311F2_5513_42F9_B689_09F7191FC8F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a34d31842e4ea5569820c1235f26b6600f0bdf926d69d5ff10a17354b4eb72d
