msgid "⟪k:0⟫(To answer all my questions.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(사실을 알려 주실 거야)"

#: scenario:scenario_08B868AA_E582_4741_B9C3_2965249FD7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
