#: scenario:scenario_B1C11B02_65A8_4A5F_A732_70D75FA8C677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 336f877cc623723f90b12c5ac43de3c2d0b35b415fa73b83c702778c9340a316
#. default-sha256: 1d44ef016ececa921a22c4828ce6b1e94ce99bb20197dfdc65387e2d5e3d3309
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B1C11B02_65A8_4A5F_A732_70D75FA8C677"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Open the door!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫열어 줘요………!"

#: scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9379ee6f753dea6372d2e7aff9295dc4cf9d8f2a321c88020175fd1b81ee6b2e
#. default-sha256: 22102f9ffb68209667d423c836e4f5fd0bd6809e3f847bb1cd3c8c427de360b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But as you might expect, the door was locked, and the priest showed no sign of responding to "
"his calls. ⟪k:1⟫The sound of the pouring rain drowned out everything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 당연히 ⟪k:1⟫교회 문은 열리지 않았습니다. ⟪k:2⟫신부가 안에 있는 낌새도 없었습니다. "
"⟪k:3⟫거센 빗소리만이 ⟪k:4⟫이 공간을 차지했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c12872c5f8f5c0628ef9298bb3d22938c30bce5ec0d74fe34ad33243383f6a63
#. default-sha256: c073ae44f72e9c3595230182a5fc74acfa904499a4a99f19469606292dffc32b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……큭, ⟪k:1⟫……."

#: scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56c5f71d647d295ba8871222b40ae42b9d14d4e8cf6718d905e19d78bf5ef088
#. default-sha256: e2b5034bbd1749fcae65209ffe5bb474ccf5bd53faf44e3efe1cdd0536273883
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His head drooped feebly. ⟪k:1⟫He looked like a helpless little calf who had wandered, alone, "
"onto a dark, precarious mountain path with no end in sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜은 힘없이 늘어졌습니다. ⟪k:1⟫그 모습은 ⟪k:2⟫한 치 앞도 안 보이는 좁은 통로에 들어선 ⟪k:3⟫나"
"약한 한 마리 송아지 같더군요."

#: scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d18f30ff5edbaab8e3b93a10164cae0a8546a44b5d03455bcf99888223c2b59
#. default-sha256: 70d281adae292818d5a3cc973b04dd0363259f84f568a4d08c68b4423a6b46a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜………."

#: scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c179bf61114dae47b7397cbfe6d48131cb24ce431e4cf0b93ae89bbe1e08973
#. default-sha256: 211aae736ab4e981d61eb2a59d5bde1d99a887688c5a06707fd633c8a7ef0cbe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why won’t anyone tell me the truth?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I want... ⟪k:3⟫All I want is for someone to "
"tell me it’s not true!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫왜…… 아무도 ⟪k:1⟫나한테 진실을 말해 주질 않냐고…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는, ⟪k:4⟫나는, ⟪k:5⟫딱 한마디"
"만, ⟪k:6⟫아니란 말만…… 해 주면 되는데……!!"

#: scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2fa831ae507cbfbfe920ab33f8d689140bffd0560de6457aedb6c69ec1426f2
#. default-sha256: 1a40da0ab9ab3afd07f99125733a3b268b164e6c04907346d710eb87fd81e251
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Have I sinned?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, I didn’t know anything!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t know—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 죄를 저질렀어……? ⟪k:1⟫아니야, ⟪k:2⟫나는 아무것도 몰랐어!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫나는 아무것도……!"

#: scenario:scenario_7676B9E7_B6A6_4D27_9D66_080D85ADA4E2
